<title>UK: BA, American poised to apply for US approval.</title>
<headline>BA, American poised to apply for US approval.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways and American Airlines are close to applying formally to the U.S. authorities for approval for their proposed transatlantic alliance, the British carrier said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;A joint filing will be made shortly to begin the formal process and that will go to the Department of Transportation and copied to the Department of Justice,&quot; a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
